---
// Buyer questionnaire: one box, two tabs (House / Condo), each tab its own form.
// Used on /buyer-guide, /chinese/buyer-guide, /french/buyer-guide.
// Without JavaScript both forms render one under the other (each with its own title);
// with JavaScript the tabs appear and only the selected form is shown.
//
// HOW TO EDIT OPTIONS: change the arrays in `T` below (budgets, bedrooms, house types, …).
